  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#structuredserializeinternal step 26.4:\r\n\r\n- EnumerableOwnProperties got renamed to EnumerableOwnPropertyNames in https://github.com/tc39/ecma262/pull/1113, so the note referencing it is currently not right.\r\n\r\n- But, EnumerableOwnPropertyNames no longer reorders keys arbitrarily, as of https://github.com/tc39/ecma262/pull/1793! So, I think we can use it directly, replacing step 26.4.1-2 with\r\n\r\n> Let _enumerableKeys_ be ! EnumerableOwnPropertyNames(_value_, key).",
